{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \widctlpar \f4\fs20 {\f5\cf4 Commander:
\par 
\par Our scientists have detected more unusual seismic and volcanic activity.  We thought New Terra was geologically stable but apparently it is not.  More eruptions and quakes are predicted soon.  We do not know the cause.
\par 
\par Many of our people are exhausted and weak from the evacuation and food supplies are diminishing.  We must establish a temporary colony here.
\par 
\par To survive we need to grow more food, mine ores to produce more metals, and reconstruct our basic scientific databases from the few computer records we saved in time.
\par 
\par More structure kits will be needed before we evacuate again as well.
\par 
\par Our people are determined to survive.  Morale is steady for now.
\par 
\par Check the Specific Objectives for an exact list of what we need.
\par 
\par Move quickly Commander.  Another eruption could happen at any time.
\par 
\par }}